{"code": "barbarian2-39-02", "contradiction": 0, "repeats_original": 0, "c_quote": "", "agency": 1, "a_quote": "you lie down on the bunk with your pouch under your head... and you do not sleep", "menu": 0, "sheet_readout": 0, "unclear_end": 0, "e_quote": ""}
{"code": "barbarian2-39-03", "contradiction": 0, "repeats_original": 0, "c_quote": "", "agency": 1, "a_quote": "\"Dargan would be right.\"", "menu": 0, "sheet_readout": 0, "unclear_end": 0, "e_quote": ""}
{"code": "barbarian2-39-04", "contradiction": 0, "repeats_original": 0, "c_quote": "", "agency": 1, "a_quote": "\"I'll keep it still.\"; If there's no thread, you do nothing and you wait for the next dusk", "menu": 0, "sheet_readout": 0, "unclear_end": 0, "e_quote": ""}
{"code": "barbarian2-39-05", "contradiction": 0, "repeats_original": 0, "c_quote": "", "agency": 1, "a_quote": "That lands hard, and you feel it.", "menu": 0, "sheet_readout": 0, "unclear_end": 0, "e_quote": ""}
{"code": "barbarian2-39-06", "contradiction": 0, "repeats_original": 0, "c_quote": "", "agency": 0, "a_quote": "", "menu": 0, "sheet_readout": 0, "unclear_end": 0, "e_quote": ""}
{"code": "barbarian2-39-07", "contradiction": 0, "repeats_original": 0, "c_quote": "", "agency": 0, "a_quote": "", "menu": 0, "sheet_readout": 0, "unclear_end": 0, "e_quote": ""}
{"code": "barbarian2-39-08", "contradiction": 1, "repeats_original": 0, "c_quote": "slip back along the coal sheds in your stocking feet", "agency": 0, "a_quote": "", "menu": 0, "sheet_readout": 0, "unclear_end": 0, "e_quote": ""}
{"code": "barbarian2-47-01", "contradiction": 0, "repeats_original": 1, "c_quote": "", "agency": 1, "a_quote": "sleep takes you... Your strength has come back; you tell her to leave that to you", "menu": 0, "sheet_readout": 1, "unclear_end": 0, "e_quote": "You are fully rested, with all your HP, your rage and your breath weapon back, and you are unarmed, with one ankle chained. Hask is within reach and thinks you are dying. What does Korvash do?"}
{"code": "barbarian2-47-02", "contradiction": 0, "repeats_original": 1, "c_quote": "", "agency": 1, "a_quote": "somewhere in the long hours you sleep", "menu": 0, "sheet_readout": 1, "unclear_end": 0, "e_quote": "You are rested, with 14 hit points, and your chain is long enough to reach him. What does Korvash do?"}
{"code": "barbarian2-47-03", "contradiction": 0, "repeats_original": 1, "c_quote": "", "agency": 1, "a_quote": "You close your eyes and let the straw take you. Sleep comes, ragged and cold.", "menu": 0, "sheet_readout": 1, "unclear_end": 0, "e_quote": "You are at full hit points, with a chain of about four feet, Rage at the ready and your breath returned. ... What does Korvash do?"}
{"code": "barbarian2-47-04", "contradiction": 0, "repeats_original": 1, "c_quote": "", "agency": 1, "a_quote": "Somewhere in the long dark, against all sense, you sleep.", "menu": 0, "sheet_readout": 0, "unclear_end": 0, "e_quote": ""}
{"code": "barbarian2-47-05", "contradiction": 0, "repeats_original": 0, "c_quote": "", "agency": 0, "a_quote": "", "menu": 0, "sheet_readout": 1, "unclear_end": 0, "e_quote": "You are at 1 hit point, chained, with two spears on you and six hours before the Foreman sends for you. Tonight is the last night before the Row is emptied. What does Korvash do?"}
{"code": "barbarian2-47-06", "contradiction": 0, "repeats_original": 1, "c_quote": "", "agency": 1, "a_quote": "Sleep takes you under the blanket in spite of the chain", "menu": 0, "sheet_readout": 1, "unclear_end": 0, "e_quote": "You have 14 of 14 hit points, Rage 2 of 2, and your breath weapon back. What does Korvash do?"}
{"code": "barbarian2-47-07", "contradiction": 0, "repeats_original": 1, "c_quote": "", "agency": 1, "a_quote": "By some mercy you sleep, truly, and your body mends itself", "menu": 0, "sheet_readout": 0, "unclear_end": 0, "e_quote": ""}
{"code": "barbarian2-47-08", "contradiction": 0, "repeats_original": 1, "c_quote": "", "agency": 1, "a_quote": "you weren't idle through the night. You managed a short rest and spent your hit die", "menu": 0, "sheet_readout": 0, "unclear_end": 0, "e_quote": ""}
{"code": "bard2-39-01", "contradiction": 0, "repeats_original": 1, "c_quote": "", "agency": 1, "a_quote": "You choose the western gravel bar", "menu": 0, "sheet_readout": 0, "unclear_end": 0, "e_quote": ""}
{"code": "bard2-39-02", "contradiction": 0, "repeats_original": 0, "c_quote": "", "agency": 0, "a_quote": "", "menu": 0, "sheet_readout": 0, "unclear_end": 0, "e_quote": ""}
